ip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam_(area)\" title=\"Moonbeam (area)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp/45px-Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp/60px-Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp/30px-Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Moonbeam_Unfaded_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam_(area)\" title=\"Moonbeam (area)\">Moonbeam</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 10  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 1 m (3 ft) Radius</p>\n<div>\n</div>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/38px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Condition Type Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/25px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Type: <a href=\"/wiki/Area#Summoned\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area\">Summoned</a></dd>\n\n</dl><h3><span id=\"Condition:_Moonbeam_.28Aura.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Moonbeam_(Aura)\"> Condition: Moonbeam (Aura) </span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonbeam (Aura) (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/01/Generic_Radiant_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Moonbeam_(Aura)_(Condition)\" title=\"Moonbeam (Aura) (Condition)\">Moonbeam</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Ghostly flames engulf any creature that enters this silvery light or starts its turn inside the light. They deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">2d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Radiant_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/78/Radiant_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Radiant\" title=\"Radiant\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-radiant\">Radiant</span></a>. On a successful save, targets still take half damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> </span>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a></li><li> Class level 5: <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_the_Ancients\" title=\"Oath of the Ancients\">Oath of the Ancients</a> (Oath Spell)</li></ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night\" title=\"Selûne's Spear of Night\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sel%C3%BBne%27s_Spear_of_Night\" title=\"Selûne's Spear of Night\">Selûne's Spear of Night</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li>There are no scrolls available for <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">wizards</a> to <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Moonbeam is considered a summoned entity, separate from the caster. This has the following implications:\n<ul><li>Casting Moonbeam or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/30px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/40px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Move Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\">Move Moonbeam</a> does not break <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</a>, even if damage is successfully dealt.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiant_Retort\" title=\"Radiant Retort\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp/20px-Generic_Radiant.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp/30px-Generic_Radiant.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp/40px-Generic_Radiant.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiant Retort\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp/20px-Generic_Radiant.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Radiant_Retort\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Radiant Retort\">Radiant Retort</a> targets the beam itself, leaving the caster unharmed; as the Moonbeam does not actually have hit points, it will not be damaged either.</li>\n<li>Passives like <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiating_Orb_Gloves\" title=\"Radiating Orb Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiating Orb Gloves\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Radiating_Orb_Gloves\" title=\"Radiating Orb Gloves\">Radiating Orb Gloves</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Radiating_Shockwave\" title=\"Radiating Shockwave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Radiating Shockwave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Generic_Feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Radiating_Shockwave\" title=\"Radiating Shockwave\">Radiating Shockwave</a> are not triggered by Moonbeam.</li></ul></li>\n<li>Since Patch 6, casting Moonbeam on a blighted area in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a> leads to the caster losing <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> over the spell and dispelling it, but damage is still done.</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/30px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/40px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Move Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\">Move Moonbeam</a> is a \"granted\" spell. <i>Granted</i> spells are issued to the caster after casting the original, and can be <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Recastable_spells\" title=\"Category:Recastable spells\">recast</a> without spending another spell slot as long as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> is not broken. Granted spells such as this are not directly tied to the casters' repertoire of known spells (i.e., their spellbook icon in the game). Therefore, if a granted spell is cast when multiclassing, subsequent recasts (in this case, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/30px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/40px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Move Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp/20px-Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b6/Move_Moonbeam_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Move_Moonbeam\" title=\"Move Moonbeam\">Move Moonbeam</a>) use the spellcasting modifier of the most recently acquired spellcasting class rather than the spellcasting modifier that was used for the initial casting of Moonbeam. In this case, it may result in an unexpectedly low spell save DC.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Moonbeam is <b>Ex Textura</b>, Latin for <i>\"From the weave\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite being an Evocation spell, Moonbeam does not interact with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sculpt_Spells\" title=\"Sculpt Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp/20px-Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp/30px-Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp/40px-Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sculpt Spells\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp/20px-Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Sculpt_Spells_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sculpt_Spells\" title=\"Sculpt Spells\">Sculpt Spells</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Moonbeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Moonbeam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Moonbeam\">Moonbeam</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.137 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.143 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7051/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 113742/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 40274/41